# PPD Non-profit — Project Context

## Purpose & interpretation

This file is the standing project context for any AI agent helping Zack work on PPD Non-profit. Use it to preserve continuity and avoid repeatedly asking for decisions that have already been made.

Status labels have specific meanings:

- **[DECIDED]** — Current direction. Treat it as authoritative unless Zack explicitly changes it.
- **[WORKING]** — The current default, but not necessarily final.
- **[BRAINSTORM]** — An idea worth preserving. Do not present it as approved or final.
- **[OPEN]** — A real unresolved question. Do not silently choose an answer.
- **[HISTORICAL]** — Previously true or discussed, but replaced by a newer decision.

If a newer direct instruction conflicts with this file, follow the newer instruction and recommend updating this file.

---

## 1. What This Space Is

- **[WORKING]** This workspace is for everything related to PPD Non-profit — strategy, operations, funding, compliance, client relationships, and project management.
- **[WORKING]** PPD Non-profit provides services including but not limited to: financial management, grant writing, compliance support, nonprofit consulting, and operational strategy.
- **[OPEN]** The full scope of services, target clients, and operating model is being developed here.

---

## 2. Current Status

- **[WORKING]** This space is being set up to capture and organize PPD Non-profit work.
- **[OPEN]** Core services, pricing model, and target markets are being defined.
- **[OPEN]** Funding strategy and revenue model are in development.

