## 3. How to Use This Space

### Folders

| Folder | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `ideas/` | Raw thoughts, brain dumps, fragments, quick captures |
| `plans/` | Refined concepts, structured plans, strategies |
| `research/` | Grants, compliance, org research, competitive landscape |
| `clients/` | Real or prospective client profiles |
| `projects/` | When something becomes a real project with deliverables |

### Modes

| Mode | When to use |
|---|---|
| `_modes/brainstorm.md` | Open exploration, generating ideas |
| `_modes/plan.md` | Organizing thoughts into actionable steps |
| `_modes/build.md` | Creating documents, systems, or tools |
| `_modes/deep-dive.md` | Going deep on one topic |
| `_modes/critique.md` | Stress-testing ideas, finding weak points |
